--- /dev/null+++ b/ION/05_context/current/audited_read_action_quarantine_membrane_context_package/ION_AUDITED_READ_ACTION_QUARANTINE_MEMBRANE_v0_1/README.md@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@+# ION Audited Read / Action / Quarantine Membrane v0.1 (Candidate)
+
+Status: `CANDIDATE_NOT_ACCEPTED`
+
+This context package defines the membrane for giving ION GPT and extension carriers broad **read visibility** and safe **typed communication** while forcing all write-like outputs into quarantine before ingest.
+
+Core rule:
+
+```text
+Read broadly from allowed project surfaces.
+Log every read.
+Log every inbound action.
+Write only into quarantine.
+Validate + approve before ingest.
+Settle before inheritance.
+```
+
+This is a protocol/schema/template package only. It does not install runtime hooks or mutate accepted state.
+
+## Scope
+
+- GPT Action Gateway reads and action submissions
+- MCP preview read/status tools
+- Extension YAML action detection and approvals
+- Extension downloads and artifact drops
+- Browser/self-chat queue prompts and captured returns
+- Codex work queue and task returns
+- Local quarantined candidates
+- Local ION ingest approval gates
+- Audit ledger and hash-chain event records
+
+## Required future implementation surfaces
+
+- `B01_AUDIT_MCP_READS_001`
+- `B04_EXTENSION_DOWNLOAD_TO_QUARANTINE_001`
+- `B05_LOCAL_INGEST_APPROVAL_GATE_001`
+- `B01_B04_SAFE_COMMUNICATION_ACTION_LOGGING_001`
+
+## Non-claims
+
+- No production authority.
+- No live execution authority.
+- No direct accepted-state mutation.
+- No direct secret access.
+- No automatic ingest.
