+
+Status: `CANDIDATE_NOT_ACCEPTED`
+
+## Law
+
+Every inbound action and action lifecycle transition MUST emit an audit event.
+
+Action events include:
+
+- action detected
+- action validation requested
+- validation accepted/refused
+- approval required
+- approval granted/refused
+- action submitted
+- queue packet created
+- selected request started
+- worker started/completed
+- proof accepted/blocked
+- quarantine write created
+- ingest requested/approved/rejected
+
+## Authority record
+
+Each action event MUST record:
+
+- production authority
+- live execution authority
+- accepted-state authority
+- approval requirement
+- operator approval evidence reference when present
+
+## Replay/idempotency
+
+Mutation-capable actions MUST include an idempotency key and refusal path for replay.
