+Ingest != accepted state.
+Accepted state requires settlement.
+
+## Lifecycle
+
+```text
+quarantined
+→ validated
+→ ingest_requested
+→ operator/local ION approval
+→ approved_for_ingest
+→ staged_applied_or_imported
+→ receipt_created
+→ parent settlement
+→ accepted/superseded/rejected
+```
+
