+
+Status: `CANDIDATE_NOT_ACCEPTED`
+
+The extension cockpit SHOULD expose an Audit panel that can filter:
+
+- read events
+- action events
+- queue events
+- approval events
+- quarantine events
+- proof-gate events
+
+Each row should show:
+
+- event time
+- actor
+- surface/tool
+- target summary
+- authority class
+- result
+- receipt/ref links
+
+Raw secret content must never be displayed.
