+
+Status: `CANDIDATE_NOT_ACCEPTED`
+
+The extension cockpit SHOULD expose a Quarantine panel with:
+
+- incoming artifacts
+- source carrier
+- hash/size
+- intended target
+- validation state
+- ingest request state
+- approval controls
+- reject/supersede controls
+- receipt links
+
+The panel must clearly state:
+
+```text
+Quarantine is not accepted state.
+```
